          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Yosuwa aca yubakira igicaniro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana ya Isirayeli, hafi y’umusozi Ebalu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk’uko Mose umusavyi w’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabitegetse Abisirayeli. Yacubatse akurikije uko vyanditswe mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose, acubaka mu mabuye atabaje, ata cuma cigeze kiyakorako. Kuri co, ahashikanira ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ikimazi c’ishimwe n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bari ngaho nyene, Yosuwa yandika kuri ayo mabuye Ivyagezwe vya Mose, Abisirayeli bose barorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisirayeli bose, bari kumwe n’abakuru babo, abatware n’abacamanza, bose bari bahagaze; bamwe ku ruhande rumwe abandi ku rundi rw’Isandugu y’Isezerano y’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " baraba abaherezi b’Abalewi bayireruye. Bose abanyamahanga baba mu Bisirayeli, n’abasangwa bose bari ngaho. Igice kimwe c’abantu bari bahagaze imbere y’umusozi Gerizimu, ikindi cari gihagaze imbere y’umusozi Ebalu, nk’uko Mose umusavyi w’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " yari yarabitegetse igihe yatanga inyigisho z’ingene bazohora bahezagira abantu ba Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
